@startuml
title COLORS Web Application - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "COLORS Web Application" {
    usecase "Log In" as UC_Login
    usecase "Validate Credentials" as UC_Validate
    usecase "Add Color" as UC_Add
    usecase "Search Saved Colors" as UC_Search
    usecase "Display Matching Colors" as UC_Display
    usecase "Log Out" as UC_Logout
}

User --> UC_Login
User --> UC_Add
User --> UC_Search
User --> UC_Logout

UC_Login ..> UC_Validate : <<include>>
UC_Search ..> UC_Display : <<include>>

note right of UC_Add
  Color is associated with
  the logged-in user's ID.
end note

note right of UC_Search
  Search supports partial names
  and only returns that user's colors.
end note

@enduml